  "name_en": "SPIDR Readout Controller Board",
  "manufacturer": "",
  "description": "用于通过以太网控制SPIDR板卡的读出控制设备，常用于连接和管理Timepix/Medipix像素探测器。可执行板卡复位、偏压与供电控制、快门触发、时钟与定时器同步、读出模式切换，并读取温度、湿度、压力、风扇转速和计数器等状态信息。",
  "description_en": "An Ethernet-controlled SPIDR board used to operate and read out Timepix/Medipix pixel detectors. It supports board reset, bias and power control, shutter triggering, clock and timer synchronization, readout mode selection, and monitoring of temperatures, humidity, pressure, fan speeds, and counters.",
  "tag_hints": [
    "Timepix/Medipix readout",
    "pixel detector control",
    "Ethernet instrument control",
    "bias voltage supply",
    "shutter triggering",
    "FPGA telemetry",
    "synchronized timing"
  ],
